                <pb facs="0882" n="796" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg796"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic">December 13,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that he has just received word from the President of Venezuela
                    that the British and German war ships are bombarding Puerto Cabello.)</p>
            </div>
